[{"id":4984407514,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKRgF2g","user":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]","id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nFixes a shutdown crash in the RD canvas renderer by ensuring CanvasTexture invalidation callbacks are cleared for *all* tracked CanvasTextures during renderer teardown, preventing callbacks from firing after `RendererCanvasRenderRD` has been destroyed (e.g., when leaked CanvasTextures are cleaned up at exit).\n\n**Changes:**\n- Clear CanvasTexture invalidation callbacks for every CanvasTexture tracked in `canvas_texture_to_uniform_set` during `RendererCanvasRenderRD` destruction.\n- Retain the existing explicit cleanup for `default_canvas_texture` (callback cleared + freed).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/godotengine/godot/new/master?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122653#pullrequestreview-4984407514","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122653","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122653#pullrequestreview-4984407514"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122653"}},"submitted_at":"2026-08-20T15:18:40Z","commit_id":"4cf308486633ddac720821366f44e773098fc97e"},{"id":5216867796,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNvMV1A","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I carefully looked through the surrounding code. The core of the problem here is that `canvas_texture_to_uniform_set` is owned by RendererCanvasRenderRD while CanvasTextures are owned by TextureStorage.\n\nRendererCanvasRenderRD gets freed first and so the reference that CanvasTextures have to `canvas_texture_to_uniform_set` becomes a dangling pointer. However, when the Canvastextures are freed, they call the invalidation callback and try to remove themselves from the `canvas_texture_to_uniform_set`. Thus causing the crash. \n\nThis loop ensures that there are no dangling references to `canvas_texture_to_uniform_set` once RendererCanvasRenderRD is freed. ","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122653#pullrequestreview-5216867796","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122653","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122653#pullrequestreview-5216867796"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122653"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-15T23:24:30Z","commit_id":"4cf308486633ddac720821366f44e773098fc97e"}]